<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0265_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Huh? {STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0} said: “Mup!” (Found this\non the ground, gang. Finders keepers,\fthat’s street law. But for you? I’ll\nshare.)\rYou want it?{YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0265_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0} said: “Pyaa!”\f(Look what I found! I want my cut tho.\n10%. Okay 5%. Okay a berry. Run me ONE\fberry, bro.)</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0265_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh! Your homie said: “Gyu!”\f(Nah. This MINE now. Possession is\nnine-tenths of the law and I possess it,\fgang.)</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0265_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0} said: “Mrrp.”\f(Fine. Take it. But I’m writin’ this\ndown, bro. You owe me one. I never\fforget a debt.)</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0265_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">.................. Oh?\r{STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0} said: “Kyuu!”\f(A Shiny Leaf, gang. Drip check PASSED.\nWe goin’ to the function tonight.)</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0265_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Your homie said: “Mmmrrp...”\f(Lemme get a quick nap in, gang. Wake me\nup when we get to the next town, or\fwhen somebody pull up with food.)</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0265_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0} said: “Prrrp!”\f(If anybody ask, tell ’em I’m thrivin’.\nGlowin’. Drippin’. Tell ’em the whole\fblock can see me shinin’, fr.)</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0265_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0} said: “Kweh!”\f(Remember when you found me in the tall\ngrass, broke and lackin’? Look at us\fnow. From the grass to the GLASS,\nbaby!)</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0265_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Your homie said: “RAAWRRR!”\f(That was to let every opp in a five-mile\nradius know who run this route. It’s\fME. I run it. Tell your homies, gang.)</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0265_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0} said: “Pyu?”\f(Wait, I had this {STRVAR_1 8, 4, 0} the WHOLE\ntime? Bro I been lookin’ for this for\fthree routes. On God.)</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0265_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0} said: “Mup!” (Ayo {STRVAR_1 3, 2, 0}, run\nme some attention. I’m right here bein’\fcute for FREE, gang.)\fNudge it back?{YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0265_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0} said: “Piii!”\f(You the hardest trainer in the whole\nregion, on my mama. Them other\ftrainers? Bums. Mid. Washed. You HIM,\nbro.)</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0265_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0} said: “Nyuu~”\f(Stop, you makin’ me blush, bro. I got\nred cheeks now. Not like a Pikachu. Mine\fcome from the HEART, gang.)</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0265_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0} said: “RRRNN!”\f(Somebody snatched my last berry and I\nKNOW it was a Rattata ’cause they\falways got crumbs on they face. It’s\nsmoke now.)</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0265_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0} said: “Hyiii!”\f(My spidey senses goin’ crazy, bro.\nSomethin’ in them bushes is a OPP and\fit’s watchin’ us. I can feel it in my\ntail.)</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0265_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0} said: “Mweh...”\f(Bro you ain’t put me in the last fight.\nI was ready, I was stretchin’, I had my\fgame face on. And you BENCHED me?\nSheesh.)</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0265_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0} said: “Mmf mmf!” (Special\ndelivery. Don’t ask where I got it.\fDon’t ask whose it was. Just take it,\nbro.)\fTake the item outta its mouth?{YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0265_00017" index="17">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0} said: “Prrrr...”\f(My toes is gone. I had four this\nmornin’. Now I got none. If I don’t make\fit, tell the block I went out a soldier.)</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0265_00018" index="18">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0} said: “Fwee~”\f(I’m in such a good mood I might let the\nnext Fed slide. Might. If he say one\fword tho, it’s on sight, gang.)</language>
