	<row id="msg_0265_00021" index="21">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0} said: “Mrrp.”\f(Highkey we eatin’ good, we lookin’\ngood, and the Feds ain’t caught us yet.\fLife is BUSSIN, no cap, no cap.)</language>
