		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0} said: “Bwee!”\f(Bet you can’t keep up. Bet you CAN’T.\nWatch. WATCH. ...Okay you can keep up.\fYour legs too long. That’s cheatin’.)</language>
