		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0} said: “Pii?!”\f(Bro what was THAT?! Nah, for real,\ndon’t play with me. If that’s a ghost,\fI’m dippin’ and you on your own, gang.\nLove you tho.)</language>
