		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0} said: “Gyu?”\f(Ayo, what’s that over there? Behind\nthe tree. ...Oh, it’s a rock. Never\fmind. Looked like a opp tho. Stay\nstrapped.)</language>
