		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0} said: “Grrup!”\f(Gym rat energy. Not the Pokémon gym.\nThe REAL gym. I’m finna fight a Machamp\fand WIN. Put bread on it, gang.)</language>
